    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "🎯 问题倾向\n整理下来，主要分三大类：\n① 职业与项目能力\n* 为什么突然想换公司\n* 什么是好平台？如何体现自己的核心能力\n* 如果现在需要开发一个核心系统，你如何证明自己能胜任\n👉 倾向点：面试官在考察 职业动机、思考逻辑、项目经验与落地能力，不是随口说说",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b5765e000000001d01fefc.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e3220622fc8acb239dcb6b5db96338c4a2b47b209f4bbf87808df37407a982a6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b5765e000000001d01fefc.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "8ce33a5823015d1d0a0a3c336b42ded27bd630e2a6e0fbc3fdc9298a23db3d39",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b5765e000000001d01fefc:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-13:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "② Go 技术 & 框架\n* 讲一下 go-zero 框架\n* 如果需要引用数据库中间件，该如何改进？\n* channel 基础：容量是 100，写入满了还能写第 101 个吗？\n* 项目拷打：项目背景、核心模块、解决方案\n👉 倾向点：考察 框架理解、并发基础、工程实践经验\n* channel 问题 → 测试你对 阻塞写入/非阻塞、select、缓冲区 的理解\n* go-zero → 微服务、RPC、代码生成、容错、服务注册",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b5765e000000001d01fefc.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "e3220622fc8acb239dcb6b5db96338c4a2b47b209f4bbf87808df37407a982a6",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b5765e000000001d01fefc.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "8ce33a5823015d1d0a0a3c336b42ded27bd630e2a6e0fbc3fdc9298a23db3d39",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
